              "text": "पारखणे — pārakhṇe — \"to assess; to judge the worth of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माणसं पारखायला वेळ लागतो. māṇsaṁ pārkhāylā veḷ lāgto. It takes time to judge people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पारखलं, tyāne pārakhlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पारख, the eye of a judge: त्याला सोन्याची पारख आहे."
            }
          ]
        },
