          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पारखणे (pārakhṇe) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Marathi pārakhṇẽ, \"to examine\", under Sanskrit parīkṣate, \"observes, examines\" (CDIAL 7904); परीक्षा, an exam, is its learned cousin."
