              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने मूल्यमापन केलं, tyāne mūlyamāpan kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is evaluated takes -चं: कामाचं मूल्यमापन."
            }
          ]
        },
