              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मूल्यमापन करणे (mūlyamāpan karṇe) joins मूल्यमापन, a learned compound built from Sanskrit mūlya, \"value\", and māpana, \"measuring\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to do\"."
